+## 8. Single Source of Truth Protection
+
+Do not create a second source of truth.
+
+Before creating or modifying documentation, configuration, rules, mappings, services, or workflows:
+
+- Search for the existing authoritative source.
+- Identify references to that source.
+- Determine whether the proposed change belongs in that source.
+- Update the existing source rather than creating a competing file.
+
