+
+```text
+.github/copilot-instructions.md
+```
+
+Do not create competing files such as `DATABASE_SETUP.md`, `COPILOT_SESSION_RULES.md`, `STARTUP_RULES.md`, or `NEW_CHAT_RULES.md` unless the user explicitly authorizes a separate document for a distinct purpose.
+
+Never create duplicate configuration files, database connection sources, services, components, APIs, routes, schemas, mappers, ontologies, clinical rules, billing rules, dashboards, handoff authorities, backlogs, or current-phase documents.
+
+If duplicate or apparently conflicting SSOT files already exist, do not delete or consolidate them automatically. Report the exact paths, references, and verified differences first.
