+# SNS HOSPICE SOLUTIONS
+
+# PLATFORM ARCHITECTURE ROADMAP
+
+## AUTHORITATIVE DEVELOPMENT ORDER
+
+Current Development Priority:
+
+1. Platform Owner Experience
+
+2. Tenant Experience
+
+3. Biller Experience
+
+4. End-to-End Validation
+
+5. Field Testing
+
+The current development phase is:
+
+PLATFORM OWNER EXPERIENCE
+
+No Tenant modernization work should start until Platform Owner modernization is complete.
+
+No Biller modernization work should start until Tenant modernization is complete.
+
+---
+
+# PLATFORM OWNER EXPERIENCE
+
+Purpose:
+
+Manage SNS Hospice Solutions as a platform company.
+
+Platform Owner manages:
+
+- SNS staff
+
+- Tenant organizations
+
+- Tenant ownership
+
+- Biller organizations
+
+- Biller ownership
+
+- Platform governance
+
+- Licensing
+
+- Revenue oversight
+
+- Platform operations
+
+- Security oversight
+
+- Compliance oversight
+
+- AI operations
+
+Platform Owner DOES NOT manage:
+
+- Tenant employees
+
+- Biller employees
+
+Those responsibilities belong to the organizations themselves.
+
+## Platform Owner User Management
+
+Name:
+
+SNS Staff & Access
+
+Sections:
+
+1. SNS Staff Profile
+
+2. Department
+
+3. Platform Role
+
+4. Access Level
+
+5. Security Access
+
+6. Audit History
+
+7. Service Accounts
+
+8. API Identities
+
+### Platform Roles
+
+- Platform Owner
+
+- Platform Administrator
+
+- Platform Operations
+
+- Platform Security
+
+- Platform Compliance
+
+- Platform Billing
+
+- Platform AI Operations
+
+- Platform Support
+
+- Platform Development
+
+- Platform QA
+
+- Read Only Auditor
+
+### Platform Owner Safeguards
+
+The system must support:
+
+- Multiple Platform Owners
+
+- Ownership succession
+
+- Business continuity
+
+Rules:
+
+- Final active Platform Owner cannot be removed.
+
+- Final active Platform Owner cannot be disabled.
+
+- Final active Platform Owner cannot be demoted.
+
+- Platform Owner can create another Platform Owner.
+
+---
+
