+---
+
+# SHARED RBAC ARCHITECTURE
+
+One permission engine.
+
+Three role catalogs.
+
+Platform RBAC
+
+- SNS Platform
+
+Tenant RBAC
+
+- Hospice Agency
+
+Biller RBAC
+
+- Billing Organization
+
+Do NOT merge role catalogs.
+
+Do NOT mix permissions across organizational boundaries.
+
+---
+
+# PLATFORM REVENUE OVERSIGHT
+
+SNS Hospice Solutions is a platform operator.
+
+Platform Owner visibility includes:
+
+Tenant Metrics:
+
+- Total reimbursements
+
+- Revenue trends
+
+- Platform utilization
+
+- Licensing status
+
+Biller Metrics:
+
+- Claims volume
+
+- Collections volume
+
+- Reimbursement volume
+
+- Revenue trends
+
+Platform Metrics:
+
+- Platform fees
+
+- Licensing revenue
+
+- Subscription revenue
+
+- Operational KPIs
+
+This is platform oversight.
+
+This is NOT staff management.
+
+Keep the concerns separated.
+
+---
+
+# FUTURE FIELD TESTING READINESS
+
+Field Testing begins only after:
+
+1. Platform Owner completion
+
+2. Tenant completion
+
+3. Biller completion
+
+4. RBAC validation
+
+5. Revenue validation
+
+6. Credential validation
+
+7. End-to-end workflow validation
+
+A page existing does not indicate completion.
+
+A route existing does not indicate completion.
+
+A login existing does not indicate completion.
+
+A feature is complete only after workflow validation.
